@startuml UserManagementSequence

actor "管理员" as Admin
participant "Vue3 Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Python Backend\n(User API)" as Backend
database "MySQL Database\n(users table)" as Database

box "用户管理"
Admin -> Frontend: 请求用户管理界面
Frontend -> Backend: GET /users (获取用户列表)
activate Backend
Backend -> Database: SELECT * FROM users
activate Database
Database --> Backend: 返回用户列表数据
deactivate Database
Backend --> Frontend: 返回用户列表响应
deactivate Backend
Frontend -> Admin: 显示用户列表

Admin -> Frontend: (创建用户) 点击“添加用户” / 填写表单
Frontend -> Backend: POST /users {user data}
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: 验证数据
Backend -> Database: INSERT INTO users (...) VALUES (...)
activate Database
alt 插入成功
  Database --> Backend: 返回成功
  deactivate Database
  Backend --> Frontend: 返回创建成功响应
else 插入失败 (如用户名已存在)
  Database --> Backend: 返回错误
  deactivate Database
  Backend --> Frontend: 返回创建失败响应 (错误信息)
end
deactivate Backend
Frontend -> Admin: 显示创建结果 / 更新列表

Admin -> Frontend: (读取用户详情) 点击用户条目
Frontend -> Backend: GET /users/{userId}
activate Backend
Backend -> Database: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = {userId}
activate Database
alt 用户存在
  Database --> Backend: 返回用户详情数据
  deactivate Database
  Backend --> Frontend: 返回用户详情响应
else 用户不存在
  Database --> Backend: 返回空结果
  deactivate Database
  Backend --> Frontend: 返回错误或空响应
end
deactivate Backend
Frontend -> Admin: 显示用户详情

Admin -> Frontend: (更新用户) 修改用户详情并保存
Frontend -> Backend: PUT /users/{userId} {updated user data}
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: 验证数据和权限
Backend -> Database: UPDATE users SET ... WHERE id = {userId}
activate Database
alt 更新成功
  Database --> Backend: 返回成功
  deactivate Database
  Backend --> Frontend: 返回更新成功响应
else 更新失败 (如数据无效或无权限)
  Database --> Backend: 返回错误
  deactivate Database
  Backend --> Frontend: 返回更新失败响应 (错误信息)
end
deactivate Backend
Frontend -> Admin: 显示更新结果 / 更新列表/详情

Admin -> Frontend: (删除用户) 点击删除按钮
Frontend -> Frontend: 显示确认对话框
Admin -> Frontend: 确认删除
Frontend -> Backend: DELETE /users/{userId}
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend: 检查权限 / 验证用户ID
Backend -> Database: DELETE FROM users WHERE id = {userId}
activate Database
alt 删除成功
  Database --> Backend: 返回成功
  deactivate Database
  Backend --> Frontend: 返回删除成功响应
else 删除失败 (如用户不存在或有关联数据)
  Database --> Backend: 返回错误
  deactivate Database
  Backend --> Frontend: 返回删除失败响应 (错误信息)
end
deactivate Backend
Frontend -> Admin: 显示删除结果 / 从列表中移除用户
end box

@enduml